  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SELAM II - Early Recovery and Socio-Economic Stability of Conflict Affected Populations in Amhara and Afar, Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project partners propose a comprehensive intervention to strengthen the resilience of individuals, HHs, and communities in Amhara and Afar (bordering areas with Tigray), in particular women and girls, by strengthening their capacities and supporting them in the domains listed below which have been identified as key for peacebuilding (outcome).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
